WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Four guardians. Four math powers. No answers to type. Choose a piece, then a glowing tile or power.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Give an ally +2 energy. Walk up to 3 straight tiles; pieces block your path. Charge reaches 2 tiles, including diagonals.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Spend 2 to remove up to 2. Slide up to 3 diagonal tiles. Drain an enemy within 2 tiles. Their next turn still restores +1.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
2 energy carries you 4 tiles. Vault exactly 2 or 4 straight tiles, jumping over other pieces. Land on an enemy to capture it.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
6 energy becomes 3 + 3. Move up to 2 straight or diagonal tiles. With 2, 4 or 6 energy, share half with an adjacent ally.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Take the last red guardian. Move or use one power each turn. Recharge +1, capped at 6. Win before the 60-turn limit.
